{"id":"tapis","lemma":"tapis","pos":"noun","rank":1698,"glosses":["carpet; mat; rug","all in (an instance of betting all of one's chips)"],"ipa":"/ta.pi/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/9/91/Fr-tapis.ogg/Fr-tapis.ogg.mp3","gender":"m","examples":[{"text":"Nous voulons un nouveau tapis.","en":"We want a new carpet.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/37976","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"to want, wish, desire","l":"vouloir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},null]},{"text":"Je déteste ce tapis.","en":"I hate this rug.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to hate, to detest","l":"détester"},{"g":"this / it"},null]},{"text":"Ce tapis est beau.","en":"This carpet is beautiful.","words":[{"g":"this / it"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"handsome"}]},{"text":"Nous devons acheter un nouveau tapis pour cette pièce.","en":"We must buy a new carpet for this room.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/28454","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to purchase"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"new, novel"},null,{"g":"for"},{"g":"it, this, that","l":"ce"},{"g":"room in a house, etc."}]},{"text":"Le tapis de ma chambre est vert.","en":"The carpet in my bedroom is green.","words":[{"g":"the / it"},null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"my","l":"mon"},{"g":"a room."},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"green"}]}]}